---
import { book } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class='site-footer'>
  <div class='footer-inner'>
    <div class='footer-lead'>
      <a class='footer-mark' href='#top' aria-label='返回页首'>
        <span aria-hidden='true'>TVS</span>
        <strong>{book.title}</strong>
      </a>
      <p>愿我们仍能在绝望之中，辨认希望赖以萌发的土壤。</p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label='页尾导航'>
      <a href='#about'>关于本书</a>
      <a href='#parts'>章节结构</a>
      <a href='#physical-edition'>实体版</a>
      <a href='#availability'>购买信息</a>
    </nav>

    <div class='copyright'>
      <p>译文与排版 © {book.editionYear} {book.translator}，保留所有权利。未经许可，不得复制、转载、改编或用于商业用途。</p>
      <p>本书为非官方翻译评论作品，与原作者、出版方及相关权利方无隶属或授权关系。</p>
      <p>原著及相关作品的权利归各自权利人所有。</p>
    </div>

    <div class='footer-base'>
      <span>{book.eyebrow} · CHINESE EDITION</span>
      <a href='#top'>BACK TO TOP <span aria-hidden='true'>↑</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    color: var(--book-pale);
    background: #0f0d12;
    border-top: 2px solid;
    border-image: linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--madoka-pink),
        var(--homura-violet),
        var(--sayaka-blue),
        var(--mami-gold),
        var(--kyoko-red)
      ) 1;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 76rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 2rem;
  }

  .footer-lead {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(12rem, 0.6fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .footer-mark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    width: fit-content;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-mark > span {
    width: 2.7rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.5);
    color: var(--madoka-pink);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .footer-mark strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .footer-lead p {
    max-width: 20em;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding-block: 1.25rem;
    border-block: 1px solid rgb(255 244 248 / 0.16);
  }

  nav a,
  .footer-base a {
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.7);
    font-size: 0.77rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  nav a:hover,
  .footer-base a:hover {
    color: var(--madoka-pink);
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--madoka-pink);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .copyright {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 2.25rem auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .copyright p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.55);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .copyright p + p {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  .footer-base {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    color: rgb(255 244 248 / 0.55);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .footer-base a span {
    margin-left: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--homura-violet);
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .footer-inner {
      width: min(100% - 1.25rem, 76rem);
    }

    .footer-lead {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .footer-base {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    nav a,
    .footer-base a {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
